To achieve supersonic speed, {{WF|Gauss}} draws upon both his [[Energy]] reserves and his state-of-the-art electrokinetic battery to fuel his abilities.<br/>
Gauss has access to '''80%''' of the battery in his default state; activating {{A|Redline}} grants access to '''100%''' of the battery. <br/>
The battery, displayed as a gauge meter above his ability icons, acts as a secondary resource that charges or drains depending on the ability he uses:

Passive
*+'''<u>0.66%</u>''' battery per meter that Gauss moves.
*+'''<u>?%</u>''' battery per second while reviving an ally in [[Death|Bleedout]].
*-'''<u>3%</u>''' battery if Gauss falls [[Out of Bounds]].
*-'''<u>15%</u>''' battery per second if Gauss stands in a [[Nullifier Crewman]] bubble.
{{A|Mach Rush}}
*+'''<u>10%</u>''' battery on cast.
*+'''<u>1%</u>''' battery per enemy hit.
{{A|Kinetic Plating}}
*-'''<u>1%</u>''' battery per second while active.
*-'''<u>0.1%</u>''' battery per hit received.
*+'''<u>0.25%</u>''' battery per melee hit to enemies.
{{A|Thermal Sunder}}
*+'''<u>10%</u>''' battery upon casting {{D|Cold}}.
*-'''<u>10%</u>''' battery upon casting {{D|Heat}}.
{{A|Redline}}
*-'''<u>2%</u>''' battery per second while below 100% on the counter.
*After Redline expires, the battery drains to the '''amount displayed on the Redline counter''' (e.g. if the counter is at '''20%''', battery level will decrease to '''20%''').

The amount of battery stored amplifies Gauss's abilities:

*Gauss passively gains bonus [[Shield]] recharge rate and shield recharge delay reduction for every point of battery stored in his gauge, up to a maximum of '''<u>120%</u>''' for recharge rate and '''<u>80%</u>''' for recharge delay reduction when the battery is full.
**Scaling is linear across full battery gauge. For example, at 80% Battery Gauge Gauss gains '''<u>96%</u>''' recharge rate and '''<u>64%</u>''' recharge delay reduction
**Works in [[Archwing]] missions.
*Affects the [[Damage Reduction]] of {{A|Kinetic Plating}}.
*Affects the damage and status duration of {{A|Thermal Sunder}}.
*Affects the [[Fire Rate]], [[Attack Speed]], [[Reload Speed]], and [[Casting Speed]] bonuses, as well as the Redline counter and projectiles fired when above 80% battery, of {{A|Redline}}.
**Adds additional effects to Thermal Sunder when battery level is above the Redline limit.

Thanks to his streamlined form, Gauss accelerates at '''20 m/s<sup>2</sup>''' instead of the usual '''12 m/s<sup>2</sup>'''.